      "id": "claim_ef447e04441c4705a9e195e4051e6d67",
      "statement": "iOS releases do not use Fastlane, Ruby, or EAS cloud builds; no fastlane Fastfile/Appfile exists in the repository, and releases are driven by Xcode plus the App Store Connect CLI (asc) through apps/mobile/scripts/ios-release.mjs.",
