      "statement": "Every ios-release.mjs subcommand first validates the Expo config, enforcing bundleIdentifier com.tomyail.herdrconnect, a numeric ios.buildNumber, ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption explicitly false, and a non-empty NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription.",
