      "statement": "ios-release.mjs provides prepare (expo prebuild + pod install), build (asc xcode archive/export to an App Store Connect IPA, requiring APPLE_DEVELOPMENT_TEAM), upload (asc builds upload --wait), and distribute (TestFlight publish requiring TESTFLIGHT_CHANGELOG and TESTFLIGHT_GROUPS, with optional --notify/--submit flags).",
