    {
      "id": "claim_263f5f2c37fe489282ffafd4e28831fc",
      "statement": "App Store screenshots are generated from fixed fixture data, not a live daemon: screenshot-fixtures.ts supplies a fake DiscoveredService, agents, agents response, paired instances, and localized history, and createScreenshotConnection returns a connected ConnectionValue whose callbacks are deliberate no-ops so screenshot scenes never mutate real credentials.",
