      "statement": "AppStoreScreenshotScene renders production components (AgentsScreenContent, AgentDetailBody, SettingsScreen, SplitLayout) inside a ConnectionFixtureProvider seeded with the fixture connection, and its root view carries accessibilityLabel \"app-store-screenshot-ready\" used as the capture readiness signal.",
