    {
      "id": "claim_c81feae42e0240249255e0939d807af6",
      "statement": "The screenshot-launch-options Expo native module exposes iOS simulator launch arguments -appStoreScreenshotScene and -appStoreScreenshotLocale to JavaScript via ProcessInfo, letting simctl launch select a scene without rebuilding the JS bundle; the JS wrapper only resolves it on iOS and tolerates absence so Expo Go, Android, and production builds work.",
