    {
      "id": "claim_600eab97f26d4a1c926a00fd0dfab708",
      "statement": "ios-screenshots.mjs ensures Metro is running, boots iPhone 13 Pro Max and iPad Pro 13-inch (M5) simulators, builds an unsigned Debug app, pins the status bar (9:41, full battery) and locale (with reboot), launches the app with scene/locale args via simctl, waits for the app-store-screenshot-ready accessibility label via AXe, and captures through an asc screenshots run plan containing only wait+screenshot steps so the asc tool does not relaunch the app without the scene arguments.",
