      "statement": "The default screenshot run produces 2 devices × 2 locales (en-US, zh-Hans) × 3 scenes (agents, detail, settings) = 12 PNGs into build/screenshots/raw, with marketing images in build/screenshots/marketing; --device/--scene/--locale/--skip-build/--raw-only/--compose-only narrow the run.",
