      "statement": "iPhone 13 Pro Max is chosen because its 1284×2778 output fits the APP_IPHONE_65 App Store slot (newer Pro Max simulators produce the separate 6.9-inch slot), and iPad targets APP_IPAD_PRO_3GEN_129.",
