      "id": "claim_259706c9adec4b44a4842e35348613a4",
      "statement": "TestFlight distribution reaches a public external test group (invite link https://testflight.apple.com/join/ZkRzJ6rm) that has passed Beta App Review; after each upload Apple must process the build and Beta App Review may need resubmission, so user docs must not describe a just-uploaded build as released.",
