    {
      "id": "claim_4d7572b712824d25a78d45f45c44e198",
      "statement": "iOS releases use a dedicated `ios-v*` tag prefix that triggers an Xcode Cloud workflow configured in App Store Connect, deliberately separate from the daemon/Android `v*` tag scheme and GitHub Actions, so daemon-only tags never archive an iOS build and a forgotten buildNumber bump on an unrelated tag cannot fail the iOS upload.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/release/ios-release-process.md#L7-L13",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2d3e4e30d377956bb6d5e94b3227a39468702ac232db824e816eceb31d0107d4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3e0a92907dab40c5ba2098812bdd054d",
      "statement": "Cutting an iOS release means bumping `ios.buildNumber` in apps/mobile/app.config.ts, committing, and pushing a new annotated tag `ios-v<version>-build<buildNumber>`; existing tags must never be moved or re-pushed because Xcode Cloud triggers on tag creation.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/mobile/app.config.ts#L17-L23",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:305fe5b7585395d2da8b0455d6c4c699d4918ffe4ae94bea77dc1f437b279838:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/release/ios-release-process.md#L23-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:752c4d119dd96678d8e50573825433dd774417429a7a6d2528ae8bc36c115da3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f4a4d943cac74eabb1147d1b20451947",
      "statement": "Nothing bumps `ios.buildNumber` automatically: `expo prebuild` on every Xcode Cloud run writes the static value from app.config.ts into Info.plist, so an unbumped retag is rejected by App Store Connect (re-used build number) rather than silently reusing the old build.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/mobile/app.config.ts#L17-L23",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:305fe5b7585395d2da8b0455d6c4c699d4918ffe4ae94bea77dc1f437b279838:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/release/ios-release-process.md#L25-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1ee3b33d3bf03832d59380b659a261292355cb2ce6d312a13d249ef201f7e7f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7e3ff3ae997e45a09a3ea12a8e81f5cc",
      "statement": "The only repository-side Xcode Cloud hook is `apps/mobile/ios/ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh`, which installs mise, runs `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`, and runs `node scripts/ios-release.mjs prepare` (which detects `CI_XCODE_CLOUD=TRUE` and calls plain `pod install` instead of `bundle exec pod install`).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/mobile/ios/ci_scripts/ci_post_clone.sh",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:1e0748fba9c3ae9da064be35db6e373948c0ff6c12626a29577b9635b109afc4"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/mobile/scripts/ios-release.mjs#L73-L90",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3468972123207dc2231f13e31772ed2a7690a8958ae51cc68d7b7aa57d7f404b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_379d76e1886f41df9a046d10d698e4bd",
      "statement": "The Xcode Cloud workflow is configured entirely in App Store Connect: start condition on tags starting with `ios-v`, Distribution Preparation set to `App Store Connect` (not internal-only), and a post-action `TestFlight (External Testing)` targeting the external group with the public TestFlight link; the first submission to an external group requires Beta App Review and later no-metadata builds are typically automatic.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/release/ios-release-process.md#L15-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e83f637fc4ae9d331ebf0ccab5eca721a36f7a094e65f3d2a2f448e0a82e10f5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_69265b8819894a17863f6de83388c6ee",
      "statement": "Daemon/app compatibility is enforced at runtime by the daemon-advertised `api_version` check (`daemon_outdated` / `app_outdated` in apps/mobile/src/i18n/errors.ts), not by aligning `ios-v*` version numbers with the daemon's `v*` tags.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/release/ios-release-process.md#L13-L13",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bd480f956c2225cb306a5b229489d7c4ff4a8fc5baa9d79db06c1111385836e4:"
        }
      ]
